%% Lab 03: the agent loop on the course's map. The model decides; our code checks, runs the tool and appends the
%% result, then sends the whole list again. Two exits: the model answers, or our turn cap stops the loop.
%% Export: npx -y @mermaid-js/mermaid-cli -i lab03_agent_loop.mmd -o lab03_agent_loop.png -b white -s 2
flowchart LR
    req[request<br/>the rep's question] --> ctx[context<br/>the messages list<br/>sent in full]
    ctx --> model[model decides<br/>tool calls or text]
    model -->|finish_reason<br/>tool_calls| check[your code checks<br/>a known tool?<br/>arguments parse?]
    check --> tool[tool runs<br/>find_customer<br/>get_invoices<br/>get_support_rep]
    tool --> result[result appended<br/>one tool message<br/>per call]
    result --> left{turns<br/>left?}
    left -->|yes: repeat| ctx
    left -->|no| cap[exit 2: turn cap<br/>no answer]
    model -->|finish_reason<br/>stop| answer[exit 1: answer<br/>the reply text]
    classDef model fill:#0B1220,color:#FFFFFF,stroke:#0B1220
    classDef code fill:#C9F24D,color:#0B1220,stroke:#0B1220
    class model model
    class check,result,left code
